{"text":"This is critical, and it's very, very important also because a lot of people spend millions, billions of dollars each year rallying support to throw more money into the African continent without really thinking about what the implications are longer term of creating such a dependency cycle. My book is not about NGO or charitable aid. That should be the sequel. I will probably write a book about that. And it's important to also stress that these two types of aid, humanitarian aid and NGO aid have problems, but the book is not about that. The book is specifically about a third type of aid, which is the government-to-government aid flows, large billion dollar packages that go from not just governments but also the big international aid agencies. Estimates of aid going to Africa this year at about $100 billion a year, going over the last few years and projected for this year.","words":[{"text":"This","start":0.0,"end":0.72},{"text":"is","start":0.72,"end":0.9},{"text":"critical","start":0.9,"end":1.28,"punct":","},{"text":"and","start":1.6,"end":2.02},{"text":"it's","start":2.02,"end":2.16},{"text":"very","start":2.16,"end":2.44,"punct":","},{"text":"very","start":2.58,"end":2.62},{"text":"important","start":2.62,"end":3.1},{"text":"also","start":3.1,"end":3.64},{"text":"because","start":3.64,"end":4.12},{"text":"a","start":4.12,"end":4.42},{"text":"lot","start":4.42,"end":4.56},{"text":"of","start":4.56,"end":4.72},{"text":"people","start":4.72,"end":5.0},{"text":"spend","start":5.0,"end":5.42},{"text":"millions","start":5.42,"end":6.3,"punct":","},{"text":"billions","start":6.6,"end":6.82},{"text":"of","start":6.82,"end":7.06},{"text":"dollars","start":7.06,"end":7.34},{"text":"each","start":7.34,"end":7.64},{"text":"year","start":7.64,"end":8.02},{"text":"rallying","start":8.02,"end":9.16},{"text":"support","start":9.16,"end":9.72},{"text":"to","start":9.72,"end":10.1},{"text":"throw","start":10.1,"end":10.54},{"text":"more","start":10.54,"end":10.78},{"text